    "section_6F3eQe": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_XAYDAL": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "custom_anchor": "",
            "text": "<h2><em>Frequently<br/>Asked<br/>Questions!</em></h2>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "right",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "text_color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_left": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "divider_color": "",
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "",
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_PLRdbC": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I book a trip longer than a week?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jyEgTF": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Choose the Personalized package and tell me your dates, your level and what you're after. I'll plan the whole trip so you don't have to.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_jyEgTF"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_KjA6gC": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What's the best time of year to surf near Lisbon?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_bwHCbn": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>You can surf all year. Autumn and winter bring bigger, more powerful swells. Spring and summer are usually smaller and gentler. The water stays cool all year, so a proper wetsuit matters in every season. Not sure when to come? Ask me.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_bwHCbn"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_UhUQMN": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "I'm traveling with family. Can I be back in time for the day's plans?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_NyJxpG": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>That's what the early morning sessions are for. A 6 am pickup usually gets you back by 10 or 11 am, so you can surf and still spend the day with your family.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_NyJxpG"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_bPcecd": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "I'll be landing late at night. Can I surf the next morning?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_hwUttH": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Land at midnight, and you can be surfing the wave of your dreams at 6 am. Early starts mean emptier lineups, and you can be back in time for breakfast with your family.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_hwUttH"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_xBKLJq": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Where do you pick me up?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_RjBWQK": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>I pick you up and drop you off at your accommodation.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_RjBWQK"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_gUpzye": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What if there are no waves?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_RnXHtW": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p><em><strong>No wave, no pay.&nbsp;</strong></em><br/>Lisbon has a long coastline and usually there is always some spot firing. But if I can't find you a wave worth surfing, you don't pay. I'll either issue you a refund or we can re-book for another date.&nbsp;</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_RnXHtW"
              ]
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "accordion_row_PLRdbC",
            "accordion_row_KjA6gC",
            "accordion_row_UhUQMN",
            "accordion_row_bPcecd",
            "accordion_row_xBKLJq",
            "accordion_row_gUpzye"
          ]
        },
        "accordion_right": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "divider_color": "",
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "",
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_jpGRah": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Where will we surf?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_wnGzne": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Lisbon sits right between three surf zones: Carcavelos/Estoril/Cascais, Caparica and Ericeira. On the day, I look at swell, wind and tide, then choose the spot that fits your level and what you're after.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_wnGzne"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_V4jEHM": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How long does a session take?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Rxjimd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Usually about 4 hours door to door. That covers the transfer, changing, a 2-hour surf, a snack and coffee, and the ride back. It can vary. Sometimes we drive around and check a few spots to find the right wave, because forecasts aren't always accurate.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Rxjimd"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_tYiyrF": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is this a surf lesson? Is it for beginners?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_pkdPjT": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>No, this is a surf guided experience, not a lesson. A lesson is an instructor teaching you the basics, usually in a group on a beginner beach. A guide is a local who reads the forecast and takes you to the wave that suits you that day. I don't teach technique, I get you to the right spot and let you enjoy it.</p><p>That means this works best if you can already paddle out and catch unbroken waves on your own. If you're just starting out, I'd rather send you to a good local surf school than take you somewhere that won't be fun. Not sure about your level? Message me and we'll figure it out.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_pkdPjT"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_FtU93P": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do I need to bring my own gear?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_q7Nbw8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Ideally, yes, at least some of it. Surfboard: Bring your own if you can. You'll surf better on a board you know, and you won't lose time adjusting to a new one. I know flying with a board isn't always possible. If that's you, we can stop at one of my partner surf schools on the way and get you a rental. Wetsuit: I highly recommend bringing your own. It's your second skin: broken in, and it fits you properly. The water in Portugal is cold, and a good wetsuit in your size makes a big difference. It also packs easily in a suitcase. If you really can't, I can help you rent one.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_q7Nbw8"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_pXrERP": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is it a private experience? Can I come alone?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_KfRYi4": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_anchor": "",
                    "text": "<p>Yes to both. Groups are a maximum of 3 surfers. If you book as a group of 3, the whole experience is private.&nbsp;<br/><br/>If you're on your own or a pair, there's a small chance you'll share the car with one or two other surfers. It's usually a good way to meet other surfers!</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
