            "text_4xM8ta": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "custom_anchor": "",
                "text": "<p>Lessons are brilliant if you want someone to teach you how to surf or learn to catch green waves, push you on to waves or simply help you paddle out to the lineup. If that's you, start there — do a few lessons and learn the basics in a safe, structured environment.<br/><br/>A guided safari is a different experience altogether. It's not about coaching — it's about getting you to the right wave at the right time. Real conditions, local knowledge, and someone who knows these coastlines better than anyone.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
